Package: opennemr
Type: Package
Title: Access to the OpenElectricity API via R
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
  person("Ryan", "Batchelor", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ryanbatchelor87@gmail.com"))
Maintainer: Ryan Batchelor <ryanbatchelor87@gmail.com>
Description: Provides programmatic access to the OpenElectricity API (v4), formerly
    known as OpenNEM. Functions retrieve Australian electricity market time series data
    for the National Electricity Market (NEM) and Wholesale Electricity Market (WEM),
    including generation, emissions, price, and demand metrics at network, regional,
    and facility level.
